We scrapbook.
我们做剪贴簿。

52
00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:08.370
Is that in the entertainment industry?
那属于娱乐行业吗？

53
00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:09.790
We love a good sale.
我们喜欢大减价。

54
00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.030
That's probably shopping.
那大概是购物吧。

55
